### List all mails across mailboxes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail?page=0&size=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get mail detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark mail as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/read HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seen": true
}

### Star a mail
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/star HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isStarred": true
}

### Archive a mail
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/archive HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "archived": true
}

### Send an email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Test email from HTTP Client",
  "content": "This is a test email sent by the JetBrains HTTP Client."
}

### Create a draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/draft HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Draft test",
  "content": "This is a draft."
}

### Update a draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Draft test (updated)",
  "content": "This draft has been updated."
}

### Move a mail to Deleted
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/delete HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isDeleted": true
}

### List Deleted mails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/deleted?page=0&size=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Restore a mail from Deleted
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/delete HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isDeleted": false
}

### Permanently delete a mail from Deleted
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}/permanent HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
